# Jace, Vryn's Prodigy: "{T}: Draw a card, then discard a card. If there are five or more cards in your graveyard, exile Jace,
# then return him to the battlefield transformed." Turn 1 Bot1 sacrifices Black Lotus for three Lightning Bolts, so four cards
# lie in its graveyard. Cast on turn 3, Jace loots on turn 5: the discard makes five, and he returns as Jace, Telepath Unbound
# with five loyalty. His -3 lets Bot1 cast a Lightning Bolt from the graveyard, exiled afterwards, at Bot2: 20 - 9 - 3.

